    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>You define where the front actually is.</em></p><ul><li>Allies within <strong>2 squares</strong> of you ignore the first <strong>1 square</strong> of forced movement each round (pushes, pulls, slides, and similar effects).</li><li>Allies within 2 squares of you gain a <strong>+1 bonus</strong> to their attribute checks made to maintain <strong>Clarity hold</strong> on a manifestation or effect.</li></ul><p>Your presence makes frantic retreats into orderly repositioning instead.</p>",
